# Only the second resolution of the Cub's ability each turn doubles. With an Icetill Explorer out (an additional land drop) Bot1 gets
# three landfalls on turn 1: a Mountain (one counter), Scalding Tarn (second resolution: the counters double, 1 to 2), and the
# Mountain the Tarn fetches (third: a single counter again, 3, where doubling would make 4). Each trigger targets the Cub.

